msgstr ""
"<action>Uključi mod naprednog udaranja loptice</action>, koji je opisan u "
"<link linkend=\"advanced-putting\">njegovom vlastitom poglavlju</link>."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:549
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guimenu>Settings</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Show Putter Guideline</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<guimenu>Postavke</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Prikaži vodič za udarac</"
"guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: action
#: index.docbook:554
#, no-c-format
msgid "Toggle on and off the putter guideline."
msgstr "Uključi ili isključi vodič za udarac."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:559
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Settings</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Play Sounds</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<guimenu>Postavke</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Reproduciraj zvuk</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: action
#: index.docbook:564
#, no-c-format
msgid "Toggle on and off the sound effects."
msgstr "Uključi ili isključi zvučne efekte."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:569
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guimenu>Settings</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Enable All Dialog Boxes</"
"guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<guimenu>Postavke</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Omogući prikaz svih dijaloških "
"okvira</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:574
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<action>Re-enable any dialog boxes that you disabled by clicking on "
"<guilabel>Do not show this message again</guilabel> or similar</action>."
msgstr ""
"<action>Ponovo uključi sve dijaloške okvire koje ste isključili klikom na "
"<guilabel>Ne prikazuj ovu poruku ponovo</guilabel> ili slično</action>."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:600
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guimenu>Settings</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Configure Shortcuts...</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<guimenu>Postavke</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Konfiguriši prečice...</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: action
#: index.docbook:605
#, no-c-format
msgid "Customize the keyboard shortcuts."
msgstr "Podesi prečice na tastaturi po želji."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:610
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guimenu>Settings</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Configure Toolbars...</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<guimenu>Postavke</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Konfiguriši alatne trake...</"
"guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:615
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<action>Open a dialog where you can configure the toolbars</action> for "
"&kappname;."
msgstr ""
"<action>Otvori dijalog u kojem možete podesiti alatne trake</action> za "
"&kappname;."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:622
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Help Menu"
msgstr "Meni pomoći"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:623
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kappname; has a default &kde; <guimenu>Help</guimenu> menu as described "
"below, with one addition:"
msgstr ""
"&kappname; ima unaprijed definisani &kde; <guimenu>Pomoć</guimenu> meni koji "
"je opisan ispod, sa jednim dodatkom:"

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:628
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Help</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Tutorial</guimenuitem>"
msgstr "<guimenu>Pomoć</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Tutorijal</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:632
#, no-c-format
msgid "Start the tutorial course of &kappname;."
msgstr "Započni &kappname;-ov tutorijal terena."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:637
#, no-c-format
msgid "The default &kde; <guimenu>Help</guimenu> entries are:"
msgstr "Unaprijed definisane stavke &kde; menija <guimenu>Pomoć</guimenu> su:"

#. Tag: sect1
#: index.docbook:637
#, no-c-format
msgid "&help.menu.documentation;"
msgstr "&help.menu.documentation;"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:643
#, no-c-format
msgid "Frequently asked questions"
msgstr "Često postavljana pitanja"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:648
#, no-c-format
msgid "I want to change the way this game looks. Can I?"
msgstr "Želim da promijenim izgled igre. Mogu li?"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:649
#, no-c-format
msgid "No. At this moment &kappname; features only one theme."
msgstr "Ne. U ovom trenutku &kappname; podržava samo jednu temu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:652
#, no-c-format
msgid "Can I use the keyboard to play the game?"
msgstr "Mogu li koristiti tastaturu za igranje igre?"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:653
#, no-c-format
msgid "Yes. Use the directional keys to control the putter."
msgstr "Da. Koristite strelica za kontrolisanje palice."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:656
#, no-c-format
msgid "I cannot figure out what to do here! Are there hints?"
msgstr "Ne mogu da shvatim šta da radim ovdje! Da li postoje nagovještaji?"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:657
#, no-c-format
msgid "No. &kappname; does not have a hint feature."
msgstr "Ne. &kappname; nema opciju savjeta."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:660
#, no-c-format
msgid "I want to design my own golf course. Can I?"
msgstr "Želim dizajnirati svoj teren za golf. Mogu li?"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:661
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Yes, you can. To enter the edit mode use <menuchoice><shortcut><keycombo "
"action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>E</keycap></keycombo></"
"shortcut><guimenu>Hole</guimenu><guimenuitem>Edit</guimenuitem></menuchoice> "
"on the menubar. Click <link linkend=\"creating\">here</link> for more "
"details."
msgstr ""
"Da, možete. Da biste pristupili modu uređivanja, koristite "
"<menuchoice><shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>E</keycap></"
"keycombo></shortcut><guimenu>Rupa</guimenu><guimenuitem>Uredi</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice> na meni traci. Kliknite na <link linkend=\"creating\">here</"
"link> za detaljniji opis."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:667
#, no-c-format
msgid "Course Editor"
msgstr "Urednik Terena"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:669
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kappname; comes with a versatile editor for its course file format. Courses "
"can have any number of holes, and there is no limiting the creativity of the "
"course designer."
msgstr ""
"&kappname; dolazi opremljen sa jako svestranim urednikom za teren njegovog "
"formata. Tereni mogu imati neograničeno mnogo rupa. Ne postoje ograničenja u "
"kreativnosti urednika terena."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:671
#, no-c-format
msgid "Creating a New Course"
msgstr "Kreiranje novog terena"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:672
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To create a new course, choose <menuchoice><guimenu>Game</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>New</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. Go to the "
"<guilabel>Course</guilabel> page of the dialog, and choose the "
"<guilabel>Create New</guilabel> course. Make sure that, under the "
"<guilabel>Options</guilabel> page of the dialog, <guilabel>Strict mode</"
"guilabel> is unchecked."
msgstr ""
"Da biste kreirali novi teren, odaberite <menuchoice><guimenu>Igra</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Nova</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. Idite na "
"<guilabel>Teren</guilabel> stranicu ovog dijaloga, i odaberite "
"<guilabel>Kreiraj Novi</guilabel> teren. Osigurajte se da je na stranici "
"<guilabel>Opcije</guilabel> ovog dijaloga, isključena opcija "
"<guilabel>Strogi režim</guilabel>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:675
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To play this new course later, click the <guibutton>Add...</guibutton> "
"button to add the course to your list of courses."
msgstr ""
"Da biste poslije igrali na ovom novom terenu, kliknite na dugme "
"<guibutton>Dodaj...</guibutton> da biste dodali ovaj teren na listu vaših "
"terena."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:679
#, no-c-format
msgid "Adding Holes"
msgstr "Dodavanje Rupa"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:680
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Switch to the edit mode using <menuchoice><guimenu>Hole</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Edit</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. Choose "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Hole</guimenu><guimenuitem>New</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice> to add a new hole at the end of the course."
msgstr ""
"Prebacite se u mod za uređivanje korištenjem <menuchoice><guimenu>Rupa</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Uredi</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. Odaberite "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Rupa</guimenu><guimenuitem>Nova</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice> da dodate novu rupu na kraj terena."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:682
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can restore a hole to a blank state, similar to when it was first "
"created, by choosing <menuchoice><guimenu>Hole</guimenu><guimenuitem>Clear</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Možete vratiti stanje rupe nazad na početno, kao kada je prvi put kreirane, "
"odabirom <menuchoice><guimenu>Rupa</guimenu><guimenuitem>Očisti</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:684
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Two items will appear on new holes: a cup, and a white ball. The white ball "
"marks where players' balls start the hole."
msgstr ""
"Na novim rupama se pojave dva predmeta: rupa, i bijela loptica. Bijela "
"loptica označava mjesto početka."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:687
#, no-c-format
msgid "Editing Basics"
msgstr "Osnove uređivanja."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:688
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The basic building block of &kappname; courses is the <quote>object</quote>. "
"Holes are made up of a bunch of objects. Objects can be moved to any "
"location, and the different kinds of objects each have different properties "
"you can set."
msgstr ""
"Osnovni gradivni blok &kappname;-ovih terena je <quote>predmet</quote>. Rupe "
"se sastoje od mnogih predmeta. Predmeti se mogu pomjerati na bilo koju "
"lokaciju. Sve vrste predmeta imaju različite osobine koje možete postavljati."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:689
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To start editing a hole, toggle the <menuchoice><guimenu>Hole</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Edit</guimenuitem></menuchoice> menu item, or press the "
"pencil icon on the toolbar. To leave editing mode, uncheck this menu item "
"(or the toolbar icon)."
msgstr ""
"Da biste počeli sa uređivanjem rupe, mijenjajte status stavke "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Rupa</guimenu><guimenuitem>Uredi</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice>, ili prisnite ikonu olovke na alatnoj traci. Da biste napustili "
"mod uređivanja, isključite ovu stavku(ili ikonu na alatnoj traci)."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:691
#, no-c-format
msgid "Adding Objects"
msgstr "Dodavanje Predmeta"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:692
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To add a new object to the course, choose its name in the list box labeled "
"<guilabel>Add object:</guilabel>. The object will appear in the center of "
"the course."
msgstr ""
"Da biste dodali novi predmet na teren, odaberite njegovo ime iz liste "
"označene sa <guilabel>Dodaj predmet:</guilabel>. Predmet će se pojaviti u "
"centralnom dijelu terena."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:694
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Bridges and signs will cover up new objects if they were already in the "
"center of the hole."
msgstr ""
"Mostovi i znakovi će prekriti nove predmete ako su ti objekti već bili u "
"centru rupe."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:705
#, no-c-format
msgid "Moving and Resizing Objects"
msgstr "Pomjeranje i promjena dimenzija predmeta"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:706
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Move your mouse cursor over the object that you want to move, and the mouse "
"cursor will change to a hand cursor. Then click and drag the object to where "
"you want it."
msgstr ""
"Pomjerite kursor miša na objekat koji želite pomjeriti. Sada će se kursor "
"promijeniti u oblik ruke. Kliknite i povucite predmet na mjesto gdje ga "
"želite postaviti."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:707
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Puddles, sand, floaters, bridges, and signs can be resized by dragging the "
"small circle at their lower-right corner."
msgstr ""
"Bare, pijesak, plutajuće platforme, mostovi i znakovi mogu promijeniti svoje "
"dimenzije povlačenjem malog kruga u donjem desnom uglu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:710
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Walls can be moved by clicking and dragging their endpoints, or you can move "
"the whole wall by clicking and dragging on the middle part of the wall as "
"normal."
msgstr ""
"Zidovi se mogu pomjerati klikanjem i povlačenjem njihovih krajnjih tačaka, "
"ili možete pomjeriti cijeli zid tako što kliknete na središnji dio i "
"povučete ga."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:714
#, no-c-format
msgid "Objects' Settings"
msgstr "Postavke predmeta"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:715
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Objects' properties can be changed in the area at the lower-right corner of "
"the &kappname; window. To edit an object, move your mouse cursor over it "
"until the cursor changes to the hand cursor. Then click. Various controls "
"for that object will appear in the lower-right corner of the &kappname; "
"window."
msgstr ""
"Osobine predmeta mogu biti promijenjene u donjem desnom uglu &kappname;-ovog "
"prozora. Da biste uredili neki predmet, pomjerajte kursor miša dok ne "
"promijeni oblik u oblik ruke. Onda kliknite. Pojavit će se razne kontrole za "
"taj predmet u donjem desnom uglu &kappname;-ovog prozora."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:716
#, no-c-format
msgid "General Hole Settings"
msgstr "Opšte postavke rupe"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:717
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To edit general hole settings, click an area of the hole that is not covered "
"by an object. When this is possible, the cursor will be the normal pointer "
"cursor."
msgstr ""
"Da biste uredili opšte postavke rupe, kliknite na površinu rupe koja nije "
"prekrivena nekim predmetom. Kada je to moguće, kursor će se vratiti u "
"normalni oblik."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:720
#, no-c-format
msgid "Course name:"
msgstr "Ime terena:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:722
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This is the name that is shown in the new game dialog and in the "
"<guimenuitem>About Course</guimenuitem> dialog."
msgstr ""
"Ovo je ime koje je prikazano u dijalogu nove igre i u dijalogu "
"<guimenuitem>O Terenu</guimenuitem>."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:725
#, no-c-format
msgid "Course author:"
msgstr "Autor terena:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:727
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This is the author name that is shown in the <guimenuitem>About Course</"
"guimenuitem> dialog."
msgstr ""
"Ovo je ime autora koje je prikazano u dijalogu <guimenuitem>O Terenu</"
"guimenuitem>."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:730
#, no-c-format
msgid "Par:"
msgstr "Par:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:732
#, no-c-format
msgid "The par of the hole."
msgstr "Par rupe:"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:735
#, no-c-format
msgid "Maximum:"
msgstr "Maksimum:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:737
#, no-c-format
msgid "The maximum number of strokes a player can take on the hole."
msgstr "Maksimalni broj udaraca koji igrač može uputiti ka rupi."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:740
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show border walls"
msgstr "Prikaži rubne zidove"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:742
#, no-c-format
msgid "Whether or not to show walls around the border of the hole."
msgstr "Da li će biti prikazani zidovi oko ruba rube."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:751
#, no-c-format
msgid "Type"
msgstr "Tip:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:753
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Choose the type of the slope - <guilabel>Vertical</guilabel>, "
"<guilabel>Horizontal</guilabel>, <guilabel>Diagonal</guilabel>, "
"<guilabel>Opposite Diagonal</guilabel>, <guilabel>Circular</guilabel>. "
"Diagonal and opposite diagonal slopes are triangles, while circular slopes "
"are circles. Vertical and horizontal slopes are rectangles of course."
msgstr ""
"Odaberite vrstu padine - <guilabel>Vertikalna</guilabel>, "
"<guilabel>Horizontalna</guilabel>, <guilabel>Dijagonalna</guilabel>, "
"<guilabel>Obrnuto Dijagonalna</guilabel>, <guilabel>Cirkularna</guilabel>. "
"Dijagonalne i obrnuto dijagonale padine su trouglovi, dok su cirkularne "
"padine krugovi. Vertikalne i horizontalne padine su u obliku pravougaonika, "
"naravno."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:756
#, no-c-format
msgid "Reverse direction"
msgstr "Obrnuti smjer"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:758
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Whether or not to reverse the slant of the slope. For example, consider an "
"elliptical slope (a circular slope). When it is not reversed, it pushes "
"balls outward like a mound. When it is reversed, it sucks balls inward like "
"a hole."
msgstr ""
"Da li će pravac u kojem padina gura lopticu biti obrnut. Naprimjer, "
"posmatrajmo eliptičnu padinu (kružna padina). Kada nije obrnuta, gura "
"lopticu napolje kao brežuljak. Kada je obrnuta, usisava lopticu unutra kao "
"rupa."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:761
#, no-c-format
msgid "Grade:"
msgstr "Ocjena:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:763
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Choose the grade (steepness) of the slope by moving the slider so the grade "
"moves towards 0 or 8, where 8 is steepest and 0 is flat. Steeper slopes push "
"the ball more."
msgstr ""
"Odaberite ocjenu(nagetost) padine pomjeranjem klizača tako da se ocjena "
"pomjera prema 0 ili prema 8, gdje je 8 najstrmije a 0 potpuno ravno. Padine "
"sa većom nagetošću više guraju lopticu."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:766
#, no-c-format
msgid "Unmovable"
msgstr "Nepokretno"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:768
#, no-c-format
msgid "Whether or not this can be moved by other objects, like floaters."
msgstr ""
"Može li ili ne ovo biti pokrenuto od strane drugih predmeta, kao što su "
"plutajuće platforme."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:770
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If a floater overlaps with this object at any point on this path, and the "
"slope is large and thus won't move the floater, you <emphasis>must</"
"emphasis> make the slope <guilabel>Unmovable</guilabel>, or &kappname; will "
"suffer poor performance!"
msgstr ""
"Ako se plutajuća platforma preklapa sa ovim predmetom na ovoj putanji, a "
"padina je velika, i stoga neće pomjerati platformu,  <emphasis>morate</"
"emphasis> učiniti padinu <guilabel>Nepomičnom</guilabel>, ili će &kappname; "
"trpiti loše performanse."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:778
#, no-c-format
msgid "Puddles and Sand have the same configuration options as each other."
msgstr "Bare i pijesak imaju iste konfiguracijske opcije."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:781
#, no-c-format
msgid "Enable show/hide"
msgstr "Aktiviraj prikaži/sakrij"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:783
#, no-c-format
msgid "Checking this enables the flashing of this puddle or sand."
msgstr "Ako je ovo zakačeno, uključeno je bljeskanje ove bare ili pijeska."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:790
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The more towards <guilabel>Fast</guilabel> the slider is, the faster the "
"puddle or sand flashes."
msgstr ""
"Što je klizač više pomjeren prema <guilabel>Brzo</guilabel>, to će bara ili "
"pijesak brže bljeskati."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:796
#, no-c-format
msgid "Bridges, Windmills, Floaters, and Signs"
msgstr "Mostovi, vjetrenjače, plutajuće platforme i znakovi"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:797
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Bridges, windmills, floaters, and signs all have similar settings for "
"configuring on which sides there are border walls. To show the wall on a "
"side, check the check box for that side."
msgstr ""
"Mostovi, vjetrenjače, plutajuće platforme i znakovi imaju slične postavke "
"koje mogu konfigurisati sa kojih strana se nalaze granični zidovi. Da biste "
"prikazli zid na jednoj od strana, zakačite kontrolni okvir za tu stranu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:798
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"There are also some more specific options for windmills, floaters, and signs."
msgstr ""
"Postoje još neke specifične opcije za vjetrenjače, platforme i  znakove."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:802
#, no-c-format
msgid "Windmill on bottom"
msgstr "Vjetrenjača na dnu"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:804
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Whether or not the black windmill arm is on bottom or top - the default is "
"that it is on the bottom. The two half-walls will always be with the arm. "
"Note that you cannot enable a border wall on the side that the arm is."
msgstr ""
"Bilo da se crni dio vjetranječe nalazi na dnu, ili na vrhu, unaprijed je "
"postavljeno da se nalazi na dnu. Dva polu-zida će uvijek biti sa crnim "
"dijelom. Imajte na umu da možete aktivirati granični zid na strani gdje se "
"nalazi crni dio."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:807
#, no-c-format
msgid "Speed"
msgstr "Brzina"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:809
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The more towards <guilabel>Fast</guilabel> the slider is, the faster the "
"black windmill arm moves."
msgstr ""
"Što je klizač više pomjeren prema <guilabel>Brzo</guilabel>, to će se crni "
"dio vjetrenjače brže kretati."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:816
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The path the floater moves along is shown by the wall it's connected to."
msgstr "Put kojim se platforma kreće je prikazan zidom na koji je zakačena."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:818
#, no-c-format
msgid "Moving speed"
msgstr "Brzina pomjeranja"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:820
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The more towards <guilabel>Fast</guilabel> the slider is, the faster the "
"floater moves. If the slider is all the way at the <guilabel>Slow</guilabel> "
"end, the floater will stop."
msgstr ""
"Što je klizač više pomjeren prema <guilabel>Brzo</guilabel>, to se platforma "
"brže kreće. Ako je klizač skroz na kraju <guilabel>Sporo</guilabel> end, "
"platforma će se zaustaviti."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:826
#, no-c-format
msgid "Signs"
msgstr "Znakovi"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:828
#, no-c-format
msgid "Sign HTML:"
msgstr "Potpiši HTML:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:830
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can enter any valid &HTML; here. For example, entering <userinput>Hit it "
"&lt;i&gt;softly&lt;/i&gt; towards the slope!</userinput> will create the "
"text <quote>Hit it <emphasis>softly</emphasis> towards the slope!</quote>."
msgstr ""
"Ovdje možete unijeti bilo koji validan &HTML;. Naprimjer, unos "
"<userinput>Udari je &lt;i&gt;lagano&lt;/i&gt; prema padini!</userinput> će "
"kreirati tekst <quote>Udari je <emphasis>lagano</emphasis> prema padini!</"
"quote>."

